&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Beta&lt;/strong&gt;: Under active development. Expect rough edges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To install or get started, either download from the website over at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://tinyhumans.ai/openhuman?utm_source=github&amp;amp;utm_medium=readme&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;tinyhumans.ai/openhuman&lt;/a&gt; or run&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
